cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "LID -- Layer-Wise Multilingual Language Identification in Compact Foundation Models"
abstract: >
  Open-source research artifact accompanying a study of layer-wise
  language identification in compact (0--4 B parameter) foundation
  models across 67 languages. Provides a training pipeline (LoRA,
  optional INT8/INT4 quantization), a vectorised layer-wise inference
  pipeline, an extensible benchmarking framework that compares nine
  optimization strategies (eager, vectorised, torch.compile, SDPA,
  Flash Attention 2, INT8/INT4 via bitsandbytes, and combined
  strategies), W&B and local-filesystem result logging, and analysis
  notebooks (Unicode-block, n-gram, and embedding-classifier
  baselines).
type: software
